    "AI 助手是一条持续的对话,不会分段。清空后从头开始,已经执行过的事项和收藏不受影响。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The AI assistant keeps one continuous conversation — it is never split into sessions. Clearing it starts over; tasks it already created and anything you saved are untouched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
