    "到设定时间自动执行,结果推送给你。系统会挑合适的时机在后台完成,如果没赶上,到点会先提醒你打开 app,打开后立刻补跑。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Runs automatically at the set time and pushes the result to you. The system picks a good moment to run it in the background; if it misses that window, you'll get a reminder to open the app, and it runs right away when you do."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
